From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan <superwhisz@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 22:20:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft perf-engine P3 adaptive AI throttle
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Skip Mob.aiStep on non-multiple-of-N ticks when no live player is
within a configurable distance. Vanilla mobs still tick every server
tick; the early-return only fires when the
AI_THROTTLE_BEYOND_DISTANCE knob is > 0.

  - throttle-beyond-distance: 0   (default — disabled, vanilla behaviour)
  - throttle-tick-interval: 4     (when throttled, run aiStep 1 in N ticks)

The SelfTuneController (P7) escalates these knobs per tier:
  ORANGE     dist=64,  interval=2
  RED        dist=48,  interval=4
  EMERGENCY  dist=32,  interval=8

Burn-in-daylight + looting checks live AFTER super.aiStep(), so a
throttled tick skips them too — acceptable for off-screen mobs.

Uses hasNearbyAlivePlayer (boolean iter of level.players() with
early short-circuit) instead of getNearestPlayer so the throttle
check is bounded by player count, not by the chunk-system entity
index size. Cheaper for the common case of a few dozen players.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Mob.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Mob.java
index cb4260791501c0c15c5a7b0509d6631fefb492b7..cd0a7f4bb25f056eaf17096ff5226d8f47c76be1 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Mob.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Mob.java
@@ -537,6 +537,22 @@ public abstract class Mob extends LivingEntity implements Targeting, EquipmentUs
 
     @Override
     public void aiStep() {
+        // SourbyCraft start - perf-engine P3: throttle aiStep beyond nearest-player distance
+        {
+            int throttleDistance = dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.perf.knob.Knobs.AI_THROTTLE_BEYOND_DISTANCE.get();
+            if (throttleDistance > 0 && this.level() instanceof net.minecraft.server.level.ServerLevel) {
+                int interval = dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.perf.knob.Knobs.AI_THROTTLE_TICK_INTERVAL.get();
+                if (interval > 1 && (this.tickCount % interval) != 0) {
+                    // hasNearbyAlivePlayer is a yes/no iter of level.players() — cheaper than
+                    // getNearestPlayer because it short-circuits on the first match and never
+                    // builds a chunk-bounded entity index.
+                    if (!this.level().hasNearbyAlivePlayer(this.getX(), this.getY(), this.getZ(), throttleDistance)) {
+                        return;
+                    }
+                }
+            }
+        }
+        // SourbyCraft end - perf-engine P3
         super.aiStep();
         if (this.is(EntityTypeTags.BURN_IN_DAYLIGHT)) {
             this.burnUndead();
